<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="pr-section pr-section-gray">
  <div class="pr-container pr-center">
    <h2 class="pr-h2">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="pr-faq">
      <details>
        <summary>How much time does my team need to put in?</summary><p>
          About 30 minutes during onboarding, then about 30 minutes each month
          to review results and align on strategy. We handle implementation
          between calls.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How do you measure Google and AI visibility?</summary><p>
          We benchmark your presence across Google, organic search, AI
          Overviews, ChatGPT, and the sources those systems use for
          recommendations.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary
          >How will we determine whether the 45-call target was reached?</summary
        ><p>
          We agree on the baseline and reporting process during onboarding, then
          review the call count against that baseline over the 90-day period.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>What if we already have an SEO agency?</summary><p>
          We can complement existing SEO work by focusing on AI recommendations,
          business profiles, citations, and reputation signals.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Does this work across multiple offices or locations?</summary
        ><p>
          Yes. The scope is built around the services, markets, locations, and
          competition that matter to your business.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary
          >How is this different from traditional paid advertising?</summary
        ><p>
          Paid ads stop when the budget stops. This system builds visibility
          across Google and AI that keeps sending people directly to your
          business.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How quickly should we expect movement?</summary><p>
          We establish your baseline first, then prioritize the changes most
          likely to improve visibility. Early movement can happen within weeks,
          but stronger results depend on your starting point, market,
          competition, and the work required. We monitor progress and adjust
          strategy as we go.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>What happens if we do not receive 45 additional calls?</summary
        ><p>
          We continue working at no management fee until you receive the agreed
          result, consistent with the guarantee.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary
          >Can you work with our website, CRM, and existing marketing systems?</summary
        ><p>
          Yes. We review your website, CRM, and existing marketing systems
          during onboarding, then coordinate implementation around the access
          and information available to us.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary
          >Do you work with competing businesses in the same market?</summary
        ><p>
          No. We value our clients and work with one business per service
          category in each market.
        </p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
